1
00:00:00,464 --> 00:00:02,504
(Leonard:)-What are you doing?
-Subliminal messaging.

2
00:00:02,675 --> 00:00:04,595
(Sheldon:)I'm going to make you want to pee.

3
00:00:06,178 --> 00:00:07,638
(Sheldon:)Dripping faucets.

4
00:00:07,805 --> 00:00:09,975
(Sheldon:)Leaky gutter.

5
00:00:10,141 --> 00:00:11,971
(Sheldon:)Peeing.

6
00:00:12,685 --> 00:00:14,185
(Raj:)It's not working, dude.

7
00:00:14,353 --> 00:00:17,273
(Sheldon:)Oh-ho-ho. It's working, all right.

8
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,270
(Sheldon:)I have to pee.

9
00:00:19,692 --> 00:00:24,032
(Raj:)-Then let go of the ring and go.
-Actually, I wouldn't mind going too. Heh.

10
00:00:24,864 --> 00:00:26,694
(Raj:)Fine, um, on the count of three.

11
00:00:26,866 --> 00:00:28,036
(Raj:)One, two--

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,540
(Sheldon:)Wait, just to clarify,
when you get to three...

13
00:00:30,703 --> 00:00:34,373
(Sheldon:)...do we stand up or do we pee?

14
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:38,751
(Sheldon:)We stand up.

15
00:00:39,253 --> 00:00:41,293
(Sheldon:)Excellent choice.

16
00:00:42,048 --> 00:00:43,628
(Howard:)Three.

17
00:00:49,138 --> 00:01:02,018
Oh. Something tells me this was a bad day
to wear suede shoes.

